sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as 🤖 MCP client<br/>(Alexa+ or Dock's agent)
    participant S as 🔌 Dock MCP server

    C->>S: initialize (protocolVersion 2025-11-25)
    S-->>C: server info + "I have tools"
    C->>S: tools/list
    S-->>C: 30 tools: name · description · input schema
    Note over C: The AI reads the descriptions<br/>and picks a tool for what you said
    C->>S: tools/call open_folder {"name": "downloads"}
    S-->>C: "Opened your Downloads folder."
